Two-state Ehrenfest trajectory through the NaI avoided crossing.

! References check NVE population transfer, energies, NAC velocity products,
! and nuclear motion for one initial condition with the built-in NaI potential.
! Chemistry adapters are exercised by the EHRENFEST test matrix.

&general
pot='_nai_',
mdtype='ehrenfest',
irest=0,
irandom=123,
nstep=400,
dt=5.0,
nwrite=20,
nwritex=20,
xyz_units='bohr',
/

&thermostat
inose=0,
rem_comvel=.false.,
rem_comrot=.false.,
scaleveloc=0,
/

&eh
nstate=2,
istate_init=2,
substep=100,
/

&system
ndist=1,
dist1=1,
dist2=2,
/
